  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mavs 201.02 Scope. The rules of this chapter shall apply to all administrative proceedings conducted by the department and shall be in addition to applicable requirements of RSA 541-A.\n\nSource. #13459-A, eff 10-14-22",
